__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# The MLRI author's copy drafts. Shared separately and deliberately untracked, per
# PRODUCT.md: they are the source of the screener's wording and every outbound URL,
# but they are hers rather than the repo's. Ignored rather than merely untracked so
# they stop appearing in `git status` forever, and so a `git add -A` cannot sweep an
# author draft into a commit.
ABAWD Screener Tool (Court Forms Draft).md
Website Draft -  ABAWD Screening Tool.md
Website Draft -  ABAWD Screening Tool (1).pdf

# Impeccable live mode runtime state (config.json stays tracked)
.impeccable/live/sessions/
.impeccable/live/roots.json
.impeccable/live/inject-journal.json
